# =============================================================================
# .env.postgres — Postgres (KB) 컨테이너 + KB 사용 service 의 자격증명
# =============================================================================
#
# **least privilege**: AGENT_KB_PG_PASSWORD / AGENT_KB_PG_RW_PASSWORD /
# AGENT_KB_PG_RO_PASSWORD 는 postgres + KB-using service (agent / insight-worker
# / web — KB query 호출 시) 의 env_file 에만 inherit.
#
# **운영자 책임**:
# - 본 파일은 `.gitignore` 됨.
# - ADR-0021 (RBAC role 2-layer): agent_kb_rw / agent_kb_ro role 별 password 분리.
# - rotation 시 postgres 컨테이너 + KB-using 컨테이너 재시작 필요.
# - `bin/kb-pg-role-bootstrap.sh --rotate-password <role> <new-pw>` runbook 참조.

AGENT_KB_PG_PASSWORD=
AGENT_KB_PG_RW_PASSWORD=
AGENT_KB_PG_RO_PASSWORD=
